{"3827570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brickotori", "steam_appid": 3827570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/23d21c47cc3c9f6b893715e58038be93.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/02eb98b422c5208fdf3dafdbc3b19089.poster.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/02eb98b422c5208fdf3dafdbc3b19089.webm?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/02eb98b422c5208fdf3dafdbc3b19089.mp4?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers. No pressure. Just the quiet joy of placing bricks and watching something take shape. Build alone or together on a shared screen. Maybe a tiny cottage, maybe a wobbly tower, maybe something only you understand. That’s the fun of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/bff96aa07a20ea8ae0623de9afe353f2.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.poster.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.webm?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.mp4?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from curated sets of bricks (from ramps and slates, to tiny details) and mix them however you like! Each palette is like opening a new box of building toys. Mix and match pieces, follow a feeling, or just stack whatever makes you smile. There’s no wrong way to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/dceabcf8e92499cbcc3189746da70b1c.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.poster.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.webm?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.mp4?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a cozy palette filled with warm reds, deep greens, soft creams, and sunny yellows. Maybe your build wants a cheerful roof, a quiet brick wall, or a splash of something unexpected. Try things out, follow your mood, and see where the colors take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ohh, and did I mention it? You can share your builds as step-by-step blueprints for others to enjoy! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you build? Unwind, create, and find joy. One brick at a time. 🧡</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/23d21c47cc3c9f6b893715e58038be93.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/02eb98b422c5208fdf3dafdbc3b19089.poster.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/02eb98b422c5208fdf3dafdbc3b19089.webm?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/02eb98b422c5208fdf3dafdbc3b19089.mp4?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers. No pressure. Just the quiet joy of placing bricks and watching something take shape. Build alone or together on a shared screen. Maybe a tiny cottage, maybe a wobbly tower, maybe something only you understand. That’s the fun of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/bff96aa07a20ea8ae0623de9afe353f2.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.poster.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.webm?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/6bf1f64b34c29a68f29071e53777c6a0.mp4?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from curated sets of bricks (from ramps and slates, to tiny details) and mix them however you like! Each palette is like opening a new box of building toys. Mix and match pieces, follow a feeling, or just stack whatever makes you smile. There’s no wrong way to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/dceabcf8e92499cbcc3189746da70b1c.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.poster.avif?t=1765398464\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.webm?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/extras/fa032416c70e34e54070e204e5c7ea1a.mp4?t=1765398464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a cozy palette filled with warm reds, deep greens, soft creams, and sunny yellows. Maybe your build wants a cheerful roof, a quiet brick wall, or a splash of something unexpected. Try things out, follow your mood, and see where the colors take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ohh, and did I mention it? You can share your builds as step-by-step blueprints for others to enjoy! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you build? Unwind, create, and find joy. One brick at a time. 🧡</p>", "short_description": "Brickotori is a cozy sandbox brick-by-brick game for 1–4 players where every piece clicks into place with comfort. Build freely in warm little rooms, follow gentle blueprints, or try playful challenges. No stress, just the heartfelt joy of creating.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/f4dbec718401076b63ed89dc81bc5ee1406abfa1/header.jpg?t=1765398464", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/1884223cb964e881635bf80df206204e76b85588/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765398464", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827570/1884223cb964e881635bf80df206204e76b85588/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765398464", "website": "https://anawimstudios.com/brickotori", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum